ocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k+QA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf47118f-1cdb-4fcc-862e-ec1171913217","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"そのときは `%v` で","ts":"1622429712.197900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"16u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9A586A56-51F0-48D3-BAC3-2A0DD7B45384","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"そもそも、引数の数と型に合わせて%sとか書くの面倒と思うのは自分だけなのだろうか…","ts":"1622429687.197200","thread_ts":"1622429687.197200","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UlQL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d35f2333-5dc4-4549-adf7-e7ad11ac7ad4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Nameで分けることも考えられるけど、その場合のキーはどうしたものか。だいたいはハッシュ取ればよいか?","ts":"1622429150.195300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cR5bc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c0ea2ae-d227-4f7c-88f9-ab2829436028","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとはtemplate.Templateをキャッシュする手はあるだろうけど、メモリ使用量が…ね。","ts":"1622429126.194800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dhC7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9aece273-d813-4491-a5ac-97183cd83f2d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁそうなりますよね。","ts":"1622429048.194000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rdjx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d7aba63-f4e2-4c45-bb91-0b87a344328f","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"```func strtmpl(text string, params map[string]interface{}) (string, error) {\n\tt, err := template.New(\"\").Parse(text)\n\tif err != nil {\n\t\treturn \"\", err\n\t}\n\tb := strings.Builder{}\n\tif err := t.Execute(\u0026amp;b, params); err != nil {\n\t\treturn \"\", err\n\t}\n\treturn b.String(), nil\n}```\nこんなん書きました","ts":"1622429038.193700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":f